text = "Instant Trinkets:
X \"Medkit\"
X Heals 1 health to the statue. Does nothing if you are at max health.
\"Flashbang\"
Explodes a stunning grenade that stops all NPC aliens from moving and using abilities for a moment. Does not affect the balls or Othersiders.
\"Energy Drink\"
Instantly fills up ability meters for all player aliens. 
\"Syringe\"
Stops all player aliens from moving for 1 second and resets ability meters to fully heal the statue's health.

Protective Trinkets:
X	\"Barricade\"
X	Places a slow and small wall that slowly circles around the statue. This wall disappears if it is hit by a ball or the Othersider, it will not stop the         X	Othersider but makes it slower temporarily.
\"Speed Limit\"
Creates a REALLY small zone around the statue that slows down balls and Othersider slightly.
\"Detonator\"
If a ball or Othersider hits the statue, explodes and knocks everything back including the players (although players are only slightly launched). The statue still takes damage.

Buffing Trinkets:
X  \"Battery\"
X   Player abilities charge quicker.
X   \"Running Shoes\"
X   Players move faster.
\"Lucky Clover\"
Players get slightly slowed whenever they hit a ball, but it has a 5% chance to disappear.

Debuffing Trinkets:
\"Glue\"
NPC aliens and balls move slower.
\"Warden Mini\"
NPC aliens have slower ability charges.

Amplifying Trinkets:
\"Ability Mayhem\"
Cooldown-modifying trinkets are increased in effect by 50%.
Not sure if we should include this category tbh

Specialized Trinkets:
\"Fridge Tactics\"
Freezer can place 1 extra ice cube.
\"Cowboy Straw\"
Wrangler now has an extra lasso.
\"Speed Demon\"
Speedy has 1.5x speed.
\"Back to Basic\"
Basic gets 1.1x in everything: size, speed, ability size, ability cooldown (for this it would be 0.9x).

Curses:
\"Black Hole\"
Lose one random trinket.
\"Scissors\"
Choose two trinkets to remove.
\"Ultrasider\"
Othersider gets faster and bigger.
\"Ballnado\"
5 extra balls spawn.
\"Ball and Chain\"
Getting hit by a ball will lock your abilities for a very short duration.
"
